## 1. Introduction

Welcome to **Modern Fluids (Premium)**, developed and published by **SkitUpStudio** ("we", "us", or "our").

We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how information may be collected, processed, used, stored, and shared when you use our Android application.

Modern Fluids (Premium) is an interactive visual entertainment application featuring fluid animations, colorful effects, touch-responsive interactions, and customizable visual experiences.

## 2. Information We Collect

Depending on the features and services enabled in the released application, the following information may be processed.

### 2.1 Touch and Gesture Data

The application processes touch gestures, swipes, taps, and other screen interactions to generate real-time fluid animations.

These interactions are intended to control visual effects and do not require users to provide their names or contact information.

### 2.2 Device and Technical Information

The application or integrated service providers may process limited technical information, including:

- Device model and Android version
- Application version
- Device performance and compatibility information
- Crash reports and diagnostic information
- License verification status
- Device or application identifiers used for security, if enabled

This information may be used to improve application performance, maintain compatibility, resolve technical problems, and protect the application from unauthorized access.

### 2.3 Purchase and License Information

Modern Fluids (Premium) is a paid application distributed through the Google Play Store.

Google Play handles payments and related purchase transactions. SkitUpStudio does not directly collect or store users' complete credit card or debit card information.

The application may use Google Play licensing or other verification services to validate legitimate access, detect invalid licenses, and protect against unauthorized usage.

### 2.4 Customer Support Information

If you contact SkitUpStudio for assistance, we may receive your email address, message, and any information you voluntarily provide.

This information will be used to respond to your inquiry and provide support.

## 3. How We Use Information

Information processed by the application may be used to:

- Provide interactive fluid animations and visual effects.
- Apply and maintain user preferences.
- Verify application purchases and licenses.
- Improve application stability and compatibility.
- Diagnose errors, crashes, and performance issues.
- Protect the application against unauthorized usage.
- Respond to customer support requests.
- Meet applicable legal obligations.

We do not sell users' personal information.

## 4. Offline Functionality and Internet Connectivity

Modern Fluids (Premium) is designed to provide interactive visual effects with offline functionality where supported.

An internet connection may be required for initial license verification, periodic license validation, application updates, or features that depend on online services.

The application may periodically verify licensing information to help ensure authorized use.

