## 6. Data Sharing and Disclosure

SkitUpStudio does not sell personal information.

Information may be shared with third-party service providers where necessary to operate supported application features, verify licenses, provide technical services, or comply with applicable law.

We may also disclose information when required by valid legal processes.

## 7. Data Storage and Retention

Application preferences and settings may be stored locally on the user's device.

If third-party services are enabled, relevant technical or diagnostic information may be processed and retained by those providers.

Personal information received through support requests will be retained only as long as reasonably necessary to provide support, resolve issues, or satisfy applicable legal requirements.

Users may clear locally stored application data through Android settings or uninstall the application.

Uninstalling the application does not automatically remove information held by third-party service providers.

## 8. Data Security

We take reasonable technical and organizational measures to protect information processed through the application.

Where applicable, these measures may include secure communication, access controls, and application integrity checks.

However, no method of electronic transmission or storage can guarantee absolute security.

## 9. Children's Privacy

Modern Fluids (Premium) provides interactive visual entertainment that may appeal to different age groups.

We do not intentionally request personal information from children through the core fluid animation features.

If we become aware that children's personal information has been collected inappropriately, we will take reasonable steps to address the issue in accordance with applicable law.

Parents or guardians may contact us regarding privacy concerns involving children.

## 10. Application Permissions

Modern Fluids (Premium) may request Android permissions where necessary for supported features.

Permissions, if requested, are intended to be used only for their disclosed purposes.

Users may review and manage application permissions through their Android device settings.

## 11. User Rights and Choices

Depending on applicable law, users may have rights to access, correct, or request deletion of their personal information.

Users can also:

- Manage application permissions.
- Clear locally stored application data.
- Uninstall the application.
- Contact SkitUpStudio with privacy questions or requests.

We will review applicable privacy requests and respond in accordance with relevant legal requirements.

